+# Sprint Backlog — Path to Level 4 (High Autonomy)
+
+Overview
+- This backlog organizes the remaining work to reach Level 4 autonomy. Items are prioritized, estimated, and assigned to logical owners (teams). Adjust owners and estimates to match your org.
+
+Sprint length recommendation: 2–4 week sprints. Estimated total: 6–12 weeks.
+
+Legend
+- Owner: primary responsible team (SRE, ML-Platform, Security, FinOps, Legal)
+- Est: rough estimate in days (dev + test)
+- AC: Acceptance Criteria
+
+Epic 1 — Scale Validation (priority: P0)
+- Task 1.1: Run distributed HPO (≥32 parallel trials) across nodes
+  - Owner: ML-Platform
+  - Est: 5 days
+  - AC: Jobs complete; checkpoint artifacts present in S3 for ≥90% of trials; checkpoint_validator returns success >= 0.90.
